# Environment variables

```bash
# AI provider: demo (default) | production
VITE_AI_PROVIDER=demo
ARTEMIS_AI_PROVIDER=demo

# Server-only — never expose to the browser via VITE_
# ARTEMIS_AI_API_KEY=

# Optional canonical URL for SEO / sitemap absolute links
# VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com
```

No database credentials are required for the current demo seed.
